"For a finite set $E$ of squares in the short interval\n\n$$\nE\\subset\\{k^2:N\\le k\\le N+N/(\\log N)^\\delta\\},\n$$\n\nlet $r_{E+E}(m)$ count representations of $m$ as a sum of two elements of $E$. **The local energy conjecture.** There exists $\\delta>0$ such that\n\n$$\n\\sum_m r_{E+E}^2(m)\\ll |E|^2.\n$$\n\nThe source introduces this as the special square-polynomial case of the short interval conjectures and states that it remains open."